## 🚨 BUG 12: Request Permissions on App Start

### Fix
In `main.dart` or splash screen, request permissions:

```dart
Future<void> _requestPermissions() async {
  // Notification permission
  try {
    await FirebaseMessaging.instance.requestPermission(
      alert: true, badge: true, sound: true,
    );
  } catch (_) {}
  
  // Location permission
  final locationStatus = await Geolocator.checkPermission();
  if (locationStatus == LocationPermission.denied) {
    await Geolocator.requestPermission();
  }
}
```

Call this after splash screen loads.

