## 🚨 BUG 15: Category Icons Still Showing as Text

### Problem
Some category icons show as "ti-car" text instead of emoji.

### Fix
Create `lib/core/utils/icon_mapper.dart`:
```dart
class IconMapper {
  static Widget build(String? icon, {double size = 28}) {
    if (icon == null || icon.isEmpty) return Text('📦', style: TextStyle(fontSize: size));
    if (!icon.startsWith('ti-')) return Text(icon, style: TextStyle(fontSize: size));
    
    // Map ti-* to emoji
    final map = {
      'ti-car': '🚗', 'ti-car-garage': '🚗',
      'ti-scissors': '💇', 'ti-building-hospital': '🏥',
      'ti-building': '🏨', 'ti-home': '🏠',
      'ti-barbell': '🏋️', 'ti-tools-kitchen': '🍽️',
      'ti-hammer': '🔨', 'ti-paint': '🎨',
      'ti-bolt': '⚡', 'ti-wrench': '🔧',
    };
    return Text(map[icon] ?? '📦', style: TextStyle(fontSize: size));
  }
}
```

Replace ALL `Text(category['icon'])` with `IconMapper.build(category['icon'])` across the app.

